 (137/21 - 85/42, 6 - 34/7) = (274/42 - 85/42, 42/7 - 34/7) = (189/42, 8/7) = (9/2, 8/7).\n\nIs (9/2, 8/7) parallel to (7, 16/9)? (9/2)/7 = 9/14. (8/7)/(16/9) = (8/7)·(9/16) = 72/112 = 9/14. ✓\n\nCheck DE ⊥ AA'. AA' direction = (169/21 - 5, -12) = (169/21 - 105/21, -12) = (64/21, -12). DE direction = (7, 16/9). Dot product: 7·64/21 + (16/9)·(-12) = 448/21 - 192/9 = 64/3 - 64/3 = 0. ✓\n\nEverything checks out.\n\nDE = 65/9, m = 65, n = 9, 100m + n = 6509.", "tool_calls": [], "created_at": 1786703969}
